-----------------------

These are the common architectural requirements used by this evaluation, not vendor-selected promises or a claim of universal industry consensus. Every main-evaluation candidate is assessed on every criterion. An evidenced narrower control earns P; the missing remainder remains a gap. The reference architecture receives no presumption of full coverage.

